  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-b0d54000f4275498b92660db",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "基于对称根轨迹（SRL）采用极点配置法为例7.29中的直流伺服系统设计补偿器。对于控制律，令代价输出 z 与被控对象输出相同；对于估计器设计，假设过程噪声与系统控制信号在同一位置进入。选择极点使控制带宽约为 2.5 rad/sec，并选取估计器极点使其带宽约为控制带宽的 2.5 倍（6.3 rad/sec）。通过绘制阶跃响应并进行评价来验证设计。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Design a compensator for the DC servo system of Example 7.29 using pole placement based on the SRL. For the control law, let the cost output z be the same as the plant output; for the estimator design, assume that the process noise enters at the same place as the system control signal. Select roots for a control bandwidth of about 2.5 rad/sec, and choose the estimator roots for a bandwidth of about 2.5 times faster than the control bandwidth (6.3 rad/sec). Verify the design by plotting the step response and commenting.",
